#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:133
msgid "Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems (Erle-Brain 2)"
msgstr "兼容的遥控发射机和接收机系统（Erle-Brain 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:5
#: 648b9182942b45e899f860963b057a0e
msgid "Archived Topic: Erle-Brain2 Wiring Quick Start"
msgstr "已归档主题：Erle-Brain2 接线快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:7
#: ca2119f2d4814ca58188159194d776a5
msgid ""
"This article provides high level information about how to power :ref"
":`Erle-Brain2 <common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot>` and connect its most "
"important peripherals."
msgstr ""
"本文提供了如何为 :ref:`Erle-Brain2 <common-erle-brain-linux-autopilot>` "
"供电并连接其最重要外设的高层次说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:15
#: 70b37b894d2b408ca6dabe8d8d42c97c
msgid "Erle-Brain2 Wiring Chart"
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:23
#: 45740347833c4c999c56c768b347cc4d
msgid "Power Erle-Brain2"
msgstr "为 Erle-Brain2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:25
#: bd6218e59dd747aab34db45ea840ad44
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 is typically powered via its \"power\" port, as shown in the "
"picture below. The power port simultaneously powers Erle-Brain2 and reads"
" voltage and current analog measurements."
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 通常通过其「电源」接口供电，如下图所示。电源接口同时为 Erle-Brain2 供电并读取电压和电流模拟量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:32
#: 48d956c68f5c49c7a8d7584e8aa87ab6
msgid ""
"Additionally, for developing/configuration purposes, it can be powered "
"using a micro USB charger (2A recommended), as shown in the below "
"picture."
msgstr "此外，出于开发/配置目的，也可使用 Micro USB 充电器（推荐 2A）供电，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:41
#: 085336918408423098ada0e1028c6bdf
msgid "Always use a power module to feed Erle-Brain2 while flying your drone"
msgstr "飞行无人机时，请始终使用电源模块为 Erle-Brain2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:45
#: 3b57fc8aa2294b0cb43df98e07b83882
msgid "Connect remote control inputs"
msgstr "连接遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:47
#: 316eee9aadd84ce480d9a7e8ef65d0f4
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 is compatible with PPM remote control (RC) receivers. For "
"traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be "
"used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM."
msgstr ""
"Erle-Brain2 兼容 PPM 遥控（RC）接收机。对于传统的单线每通道（PWM）接收机，可使用 PPM 编码器将接收机输出转换为 PPM-"
"SUM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:51
#: 1f5c7c6fb5574ac9a7c94c4d7abc4ab8
msgid ""
"For more information see :ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver "
"Systems (Erle-Brain 2) <common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-"
"systems-erle-brain-2>`."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 :ref:`兼容的遥控发射机和接收机系统（Erle-Brain 2）<common-compatible-rc-"
"transmitter-and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:56
#: e4fe123c1540439db5722a975461d505
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis 遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:59
#: 4073d5ce91744e87a85d6241cca139b2
msgid "GPS+Compass"
msgstr "GPS+罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:61
#: 0db27ad91033429286b7670dd6a019a1
msgid ""
"The `uBlox GPS + Compass Module <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product"
"/gpscompass-ublox-neo-m8n-gps-with-compass-kit/>`__ is the recommended "
"GPS for Erle-Brain2. The GPS port is connected with the six-position DF13"
" cable, and the Compass port is connected to the I2C port with the four-"
"position DF13 cable, as shown in the :ref:`wiring chart above <common-"
"erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start_erle-brain2_wiring_chart>`."
msgstr ""
"`uBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-"
"ublox-neo-m8n-gps-with-compass-kit/>`__ 是 Erle-Brain2 推荐使用的 GPS。GPS "
"接口使用六针 DF13 线缆连接，罗盘接口使用四针 DF13 线缆连接到 I2C 接口，如 :ref:`上方接线图 <common-erle-"
"brain2-wiring-quick-start_erle-brain2_wiring_chart>` 所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:68
#: 6c055dbf32be40deb40618942cb0b7c9
msgid "Connect Motors"
msgstr "连接电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:75
#: aaba13d0f30a4778b0ad7c1aeed6e8c0
msgid ""
"Be aware of how you connect ESCs wires to PWM rail. The signal wire "
"(white or orange color) should be connected at the top, the ground wire "
"(black or brown color) at the bottom."
msgstr "注意电调线缆连接到 PWM 总线的方式。信号线（白色或橙色）应连接在上方，地线（黑色或棕色）应连接在下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:86
#: 54ce9e58a0684e4f99ffad655da8ec2b
msgid "USB ports"
msgstr "USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:88
#: 97186f44eb9d49559e24826ac7892751
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 has four USB ports. Some of the devices you can connect are "
"listed in the following section."
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 有四个 USB 接口。以下部分列出了一些可连接的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:92
#: 8a9d395cc55e4c789b9205981d440a57
msgid "WiFi dongle"
msgstr "WiFi 接收器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:94
#: 7c2134ade0ed4325b86a66b6e102d2b0
msgid ""
"Use a (regular or high gain) WiFi dongle to create a hotspot that can, "
"for example, be used for sending telemetry data and commands to a Ground "
"Station. Erle-Brain2 automatically generates a WiFi hotspot when the "
"dongle is connected."
msgstr ""
"使用（普通或高增益）WiFi 接收器创建热点，例如用于向地面站发送数传数据和指令。当接收器连接后，Erle-Brain2 会自动生成 WiFi "
"热点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:101
#: 07878abf2d664fd3afc1bd31b1d3a248
msgid ""
"Edimax AC (regular and high gain) are the officially supported dongles. "
"These can be purchased from Erle-Brain with your autopilot/vehicle."
msgstr "Edimax AC（普通和高增益）是官方支持的接收器。可随飞控/飞行器一起从 Erle-Brain 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:106
#: b3dc99979f844945ad052cad0ed6cff0
msgid "Bluetooth dongle"
msgstr "蓝牙接收器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:108
#: d8d1de3418204c13bc1a993bdf16ee14
msgid "Use a Bluetooth dongle to connect additional devices, such as joysticks."
msgstr "使用蓝牙接收器连接其他设备，例如游戏手柄。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:112
#: 6c12ba53480a4a17a9dae216753375e2
msgid "You will need to configure BlueTooth interface to make it work"
msgstr "您需要配置蓝牙接口才能使其正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:118
#: 646de403064d4c469d688500ee2b0602
msgid "Connect other peripherals"
msgstr "连接其他外设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:120
#: 8792a63e2f57403484e2d090391448c0
msgid ""
"Depending on your hardware there may be any number of other peripherals "
"attached, including sensors, cameras, grippers etc. These can be found as"
" sub-pages of the topic :ref:`Optional Hardware <common-optional-"
"hardware>`."
msgstr ""
"根据您的硬件，可能还需要连接其他外设，包括传感器、摄像头、抓手等。这些内容可在 :ref:`可选硬件 <common-optional-"
"hardware>` 主题的子页面中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:124
#: 6a29f10633074f7b986871a370e16be2
msgid ""
"More information in `official documentation "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Additional_Sensors/Lidar.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 `官方文档 "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/Artificial_Brains_and_Autopilots/Additional_Sensors/Lidar.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:127
#: d0760fc8b52e47eda14d4800640a8c33
msgid "Related information"
msgstr "相关信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:129
#: 5558623a041f4fbfba83e6cdd76a32a0
msgid ""
"`Erle Robotics official documentation <http://docs.erlerobotics.com/>`__ "
"includes additional information about how to use Erle-Brain2."
msgstr ""
"`Erle Robotics 官方文档 <http://docs.erlerobotics.com/>`__ 包含有关如何使用 Erle-"
"Brain2 的更多信息。"

